{
 "description": "Virtual time: the decoder's data plane is lost, so the prefiller's WRITEs fail; two data-plane faults leave the prefiller a 1 s reconnect backoff toward the decoder. A request on the prefiller that itself fetches from the decoder (remote_prefiller naming the decoder) cannot open a session inside the backoff, so its lookups MISS; 1.5 s later a request opens one and HITs.",
